{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2TH","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"帖撒罗尼迦后书","commonName":"帖撒罗尼迦后书","title":"帖撒罗尼迦后书","order":53,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"d06899dc062ef78a40595ed97061020d0ece28da87d42eda6b730ed5aaa56052","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2TH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2TH/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":47},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["问候"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["保罗、西拉、提摩太写信给帖撒罗尼迦、在 神—我们的父与主耶稣基督里的教会。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["愿恩惠、平安从父 神和主耶稣基督归与你们！"]},{"type":"heading","content":["基督再来时的审判"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["弟兄们，我们该为你们常常感谢 神，这本是合宜的；因你们的信心格外增长，并且你们众人彼此相爱的心也都充足。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["甚至我们在 神的各教会里为你们夸口，都因你们在所受的一切逼迫患难中，仍旧存忍耐和信心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["这正是 神公义判断的明证，叫你们可算配得 神的国；你们就是为这国受苦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["神既是公义的，就必将患难报应那加患难给你们的人，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["也必使你们这受患难的人与我们同得平安。那时，主耶稣同他有能力的天使从天上在火焰中显现，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["要报应那不认识 神和那不听从我主耶稣福音的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他们要受刑罚，就是永远沉沦，离开主的面和他权能的荣光。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["这正是主降临、要在他圣徒的身上得荣耀、又在一切信的人身上显为希奇的那日子。我们对你们作的见证，你们也信了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因此，我们常为你们祷告，愿我们的 神看你们配得过所蒙的召，又用大能成就你们一切所羡慕的良善和一切因信心所做的工夫，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["叫我们主耶稣的名在你们身上得荣耀，你们也在他身上得荣耀，都照着我们的 神并主耶稣基督的恩。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2TH/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2TH/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TH/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}